The NetIEC bridge: /opt/vice-fujinet/lib/libopencbm.so
  From fujinet/opencbm-netiec in https://github.com/dillera/vice-fn
  License: GPL-2+, as VICE

FujiNet-PC: /opt/vice-fujinet/fujinet-pc
  Copyright the FujiNet contributors;
  https://github.com/FujiNetWIFI/fujinet-firmware
  With the changes in https://github.com/dillera/fujinet-firmware
